# DemonKnight — Cursor Project Rules

Unity project name: **DemonKnight**. Gameplay systems use namespace `ArthurianAutobattler`.

## Stack
- Unity 6.6 / 6000.x — 2D URP, C#, TextMeshPro, Unity UI Canvas
- Project / product name: `DemonKnight`
- Single C# namespace: `ArthurianAutobattler`
- Script layout under `Assets/Scripts/`:
  - `Data/` — shared enums & data types (`RecruitInstance`, `CombatUnit`, traits, roles)
  - `Persistence/` — staged grudge JSON + Merlin Royal Supply Bank
  - `Systems/` — game loop, town RNG, fusion, tavern dice, perk draft
  - `Combat/` — horde gen, autobattler tick, 2D visuals / floating text
  - `UI/` — 3-split town canvas + Legend Codex

## High-Level Loop
1. **TownRecruit (300–600s timer, default 420)** — hire from 52 persistent citizens (12 Knights / 15 Warriors / 25 Peasants), scout intel tiers, train Tank/Ranged, mediate, tavern dice, fuse legends.
2. **AutoBattle** — frontlineSize=6; demons chaotic/unorganized; clear FrontlineTank before BacklineRanged.
3. **Rewards / PerkDraft** — pick 1 of 3 run perks; shrink next town timer by 30s (floor 180).
4. **Resurrection** — Merlin rewinds; Legacy Points → Royal Bank; grudges commit to disk.

## Persistence Invariants
- Stage grudges in memory during a run.
- Write `Application.persistentDataPath/grudge_memory.json` **only** on full run end (Nimue win, battle loss, or Camelot Abandoned priced-out).
- Bank levels live in PlayerPrefs (`LegacyPoints`, `BankGoldLvl`, `BankDiscountLvl`, `BankRationsLvl`).

## Boss Ladder
- W2 Black Knight · W3 Vortigern · W4 Green Knight · W5 Accolon · W6+ Nimue (petrify + seduce unless Arthur/Galahad).

## Fusion Recipes (Legend Codex)
Priest 2P · Captain 2W · Arthur 2K+1Cap · Merlin 3Pr+2W+2K · Lancelot 3K(1 Noble) · Morgan 2Pr+2 Outlaw · Lady 3Pr+1Cap · Gawain 2W+2K · Mordred 2K+2 Outlaw · Galahad 2 Zealot/Loyalist K + 1 Priest.

## Coding Standards
- `TextMeshProUGUI` for all UI text.
- `FindFirstObjectByType<T>()` — never deprecated `FindObjectOfType`.
- Keep combat math in `AutoBattlerEngine`; visuals only via `BattlefieldVisualizer`.
- Clone recruit stats before battle modifiers so perks do not double-stack across waves.
- King Arthur present → nullify hatedTrait rivalry nerfs (love synergies still apply).
- Editor menu: **Arthurian / Build Complete Scene Hierarchy** (`Assets/Editor/ArthurianSceneBuilder.cs`).

## Do Not
- Rename the namespace without updating every script.
- Commit staged grudges mid-run.
- Add auth / networking / cloud saves unless asked.
- Replace TextMeshPro with legacy UI Text.
